### ADR Discipline (Mandatory)
- Required before any architectural change.
- Location: docs/adr/YYYY-MM-DD-title.md
- Must include:
- Context
- Decision
- Consequences
- Status

### Configuration Rules
- All limits must be:
- validated
- versioned
- auditable
- Emit ConfigLoaded events with hash/version.

